    /region_name=\"Region of interest in the sequence\"\n                     /note=\"CAHS motif 2.\n                     /evidence=ECO:0000250|UniProtKB:J7M799.\"\n     Region          205..227\n                     /region_name=\"Region of interest in the sequence\"\n                     /note=\"Disordered. /evidence=ECO:0000256|SAM:MobiDB-lite.\"\n     Region          205..219\n                     /region_name=\"Compositionally biased region\"\n                     /note=\"Low complexity.\n                     /evidence=ECO:0000256|SAM:MobiDB-lite.\"\nORIGIN      \n        1 msgrnveshm ernekvvvnn sghadvkkqq qqvehtefth tevkaplihp appiistgaa\n       61 glaeeivgqg ftasaarisg gtaeihlqps aamteearrd qeryrqeqes iakqqereme\n      121 kkteayrkta eaeaekirke lekqhardve frkdliesti drqkrevdle akmakreldr\n      181 egqlakeale rsrlatnvev nfdsaaghtv sggttvstsd kmeikrn\n//","fileName":"NCBI EFetch GenPept","recordIndex":22,"importedAt":"2026-11-02T16:29:24.735Z","sourceOrigin":{"type":"ncbi_efetch_genpept","name":"NCBI EFetch GenPept"}},"P0CU50":{"accession":"P0CU50","accessionVersion":"P0CU50.2","locus":"CAHS8_HYPEX 227 aa linear INV 02-SEP-2026","definition":"RecName: Full=Cytosolic-abundant heat soluble protein 94063; Short=CAHS 94063; AltName: Full=Cytosolic abundant heat-soluble protein 8; AltName: Full=Tardigrade-specific intrinsically disordered protein CAHS 94063; Short=TDP CAHS 94063.","sourceName":"Hypsibius exemplaris","organism":"Hypsibius exemplaris","lineage":["Eukaryota","Metazoa","Ecdysozoa","Tardigrada","Eutardigrada","Parachela","Hypsibioidea","Hypsibiidae","Hypsibius"],"taxid":"2072580","sequenceLength":227,"sequence":"MSGRNVESHMERNEKVVVNNSGHADVKKQQQQVEHTEFTHTEVKAPLIHPAPPIISTGAAGLAEEIVGQGFTASAARISGGTAEIHLQPSAAMTEEARRDQERYRQEQESIAKQQEREMEKKTEAYRKTAEAEAEKIRKELEKQHARDVEFRKDLIESTIDRQKREVDLEAKMAKRELDREGQLAKEALERSRLATNVEVNFDSAAGHTVSGGTTVSTSDKMEIKRN","annotations":{"manualQueryRange":null,"sources":[{"featureType":"source","featureClass":"source","label":"Hypsibius e