out by EBP-Nor (https://www.ebpnor.org/).\n            tzFluFoli1.1 is based on 69x PacBio HiFi data and 43x Arima Hi-C\n            data. The HiFi reads were filtered for adapters using\n            HiFiAdapterFilt, and assembled with hifiasm along with Hi-C data to\n            generate a pair of haplotype-resolved assemblies. K-mers from the\n            two assemblies were used to filter Hi-C reads to create two sets of\n            reads for scaffolding the assemblies (i.e., reads used to scaffold\n            hap1 did not contain k-mers unique to hap2). YaHS was used for\n            scaffolding. FCS-adaptor was used to remove putative adapters, and\n            putative contaminants were removed with FCS-GX. The chromosomes\n            confirmed by Hi-C data are named according to size.\nFEATURES             Location/Qualifiers\n     source          1..9956\n                     /organism=\"Flustra foliacea\"\n                     /db_xref=\"taxon:478208\"\n                     /chromosome=\"8\"\n                     /geo_loc_name=\"Norway:Arendal\"\n                     /collection_date=\"2022-04-07\"\n     Protein         1..9956\n                     /name=\"unnamed protein product\"\n     Region          6739..>6774\n                     /region_name=\"Ephrin_rec_like\"\n                     /note=\"Tyrosine-protein kinase ephrin type A/B\n                     receptor-like; pfam07699\"\n                     /db_xref=\"CDD:429604\"\n     Region          <8673..9417\n                     /region_name=\"PTZ00121\"\n                     /note=\"MAEBL; Provisional\"\n                     /db_xref=\"CDD:173412\"\n     Region          9363..>9537\n                     /region_name=\"CAF-1_p150\"\n                     /note=\"Chromatin assembly factor 1 complex p150 subunit,\n                     N-terminal; pfam11600\"\n                     /db_xref=\"CDD:402959\"\n     CDS             1..9956\n                     /locus_tag=\"TZFLFO1EN1_LOCUS14788\"\n       