15040, OZ276492.1:9815576..9815743,OZ276492.1:9816581..9816661, OZ276492.1:9817442..9817600)","note":"ID:FUNCC00000014788; source:EVM"},"featureId":"CAN6065479.1:feature:6"}],"featureSummary":{"total":6,"sources":1,"genes":0,"proteins":1,"regions":3,"sites":0,"otherFeatures":1}},"rawText":"LOCUS       CAN6065479              9956 aa            linear   INV 01-JUL-2025\nDEFINITION  unnamed protein product [Flustra foliacea].\nACCESSION   CAN6065479\nVERSION     CAN6065479.1\nDBLINK      BioProject: PRJEB89785\n            BioSample: SAMEA118341102\n            Sequence Read Archive: ERR15004908, ERR15004909, ERR15004988\nDBSOURCE    embl accession OZ276492.1\nKEYWORDS    .\nSOURCE      Flustra foliacea (greater hornwrack)\n  ORGANISM  Flustra foliacea\n            Eukaryota; Metazoa; Spiralia; Lophotrochozoa; Bryozoa;\n            Gymnolaemata; Cheilostomatida; Flustrina; Flustroidea; Flustridae;\n            Flustra.\nREFERENCE   1\n  CONSRTM   ELIXIR-Norway, Elixir Norway\n  TITLE     Direct Submission\n  JOURNAL   Submitted (20-JUN-2025) ELIXIR-Norway, Thormoehlens gt 55, 5008\n            Bergen, Norway\nCOMMENT     This project provides the diploid genome assembly tzFluFoli1.1 of\n            the broad-leaved hornwrack, Flustra foliacea. The sample was\n            provided by P. Kuklinski and E. Svensen, and the data generation\n            and assembly were carried out by EBP-Nor (https://www.ebpnor.org/).\n            tzFluFoli1.1 is based on 69x PacBio HiFi data and 43x Arima Hi-C\n            data. The HiFi reads were filtered for adapters using\n            HiFiAdapterFilt, and assembled with hifiasm along with Hi-C data to\n            generate a pair of haplotype-resolved assemblies. K-mers from the\n            two assemblies were used to filter Hi-C reads to create two sets of\n            reads for scaffolding the assemblies (i.e., reads used to scaffold\n            hap1 did not contain k-mers unique to hap2). YaHS was used for\n            scaffolding. FCS-adaptor was used to remove putative adapters, and\n            putative contaminants were removed with FCS-GX. The chromosomes\n            confirmed by Hi-C data are named according to size.\nFEATURES             Location/Qualifiers\n     source          1..9956\n                     /organism=\"Flustra foliacea\"\n                     /db_xref=\"taxon:478208\"\n                     /chromosome=\"8\"\n                     /geo_loc_name=\"Norway:Arendal\"\n                     /collection_date=\"2022-04-07\"\n     Protein         1..9956\n                     /name=\"unnamed protein product\"\n     Region          6739..>6774\n                     /region_name=\"Ephrin_rec_like\"\n                     /note=\"Tyrosine-protein kinase ephrin type A/B\n                     receptor-like; pfam07699\"\n                     /db_xref=\"CDD:429604\"\n     Region          <8673..9417\n                     /region_name=\"PTZ00121\"\n                     /note=\"MAEBL; Provisional\"\n                     /db_xref=\"CDD:173412\"\n     Region          9363..>9537\n                     /region_name=\"CAF-1_p150\"\n                     /note=\"Chromatin assembly factor 1 complex p150 subunit,\n                     N-terminal; pfam11600\"\n                     /db_xref=\"CDD:402959\"\n     CDS             1..9956\n                     /locus_tag=\"TZFLFO1EN1_LOCUS14788\"\n                     /coded_by=\"join(OZ276492.1:9530283..9530389,\n                     OZ276492.1:9531808..9531895,OZ276492.1:9532832..9533066,\n                     OZ276492.1:9535004..9535147,OZ276492.1:9535689..9535881,\n                     OZ276492.1:9537255..9537373,OZ276492.1:9539431..9539547,\n                     OZ276492.1:9540507..9540728,OZ276492.1:9541247..9541393,\n                     OZ276492.1:9542176..9542347,OZ276492.1:9543511..9543687,\n                     OZ276492.1:9543952..9544182,OZ276492.1:9545008..9545192,\n                     OZ276492.1:9547168..9547404,OZ276492.1:9548217..95