eration and assembly were carried out by EBP-Nor\n            (https://www.ebpnor.org/). tzFluFoli1.1 is based on 69x PacBio HiFi\n            data and 43x Arima Hi-C data. The HiFi reads were filtered for\n            adapters using HiFiAdapterFilt, and assembled with hifiasm along\n            with Hi-C data to generate a pair of haplotype-resolved assemblies.\n            K-mers from the two assemblies were used to filter Hi-C reads to\n            create two sets of reads for scaffolding the assemblies (i.e.,\n            reads used to scaffold hap1 did not contain k-mers unique to hap2).\n            YaHS was used for scaffolding. FCS-adaptor was used to remove\n            putative adapters, and putative contaminants were removed with\n            FCS-GX. The chromosomes confirmed by Hi-C data are named according\n            to size.\nFEATURES             Location/Qualifiers\n     source          1..9962\n                     /organism=\"Flustra foliacea\"\n                     /db_xref=\"taxon:478208\"\n                     /chromosome=\"8\"\n                     /geo_loc_name=\"Norway:Arendal\"\n                     /collection_date=\"2022-04-07\"\n     Protein         1..9962\n                     /name=\"unnamed protein product\"\n     Region          179..>275\n                     /region_name=\"TNFRSF\"\n                     /note=\"Tumor necrosis factor receptor superfamily\n                     (TNFRSF); cl22855\"\n                     /db_xref=\"CDD:473981\"\n     Region          199..244\n                     /region_name=\"CRD2\"\n                     /note=\"CRD2 [structural motif]\"\n                     /db_xref=\"CDD:276900\"\n     Region          6739..>6774\n                     /region_name=\"Ephrin_rec_like\"\n                     /note=\"Tyrosine-protein kinase ephrin type A/B\n                     receptor-like; pfam07699\"\n                     /db_xref=\"CDD:429604\"\n     Region          <8679..9423\n                     /region_name=