ds used to scaffold hap1 did not contain k-mers unique to hap2).\n            YaHS was used for scaffolding. FCS-adaptor was used to remove\n            putative adapters, and putative contaminants were removed with\n            FCS-GX. The chromosomes confirmed by Hi-C data are named according\n            to size.\nFEATURES             Location/Qualifiers\n     source          1..9962\n                     /organism=\"Flustra foliacea\"\n                     /db_xref=\"taxon:478208\"\n                     /chromosome=\"8\"\n                     /geo_loc_name=\"Norway:Arendal\"\n                     /collection_date=\"2022-04-07\"\n     Protein         1..9962\n                     /name=\"unnamed protein product\"\n     Region          179..>275\n                     /region_name=\"TNFRSF\"\n                     /note=\"Tumor necrosis factor receptor superfamily\n                     (TNFRSF); cl22855\"\n                     /db_xref=\"CDD:473981\"\n     Region          199..244\n                     /region_name=\"CRD2\"\n                     /note=\"CRD2 [structural motif]\"\n                     /db_xref=\"CDD:276900\"\n     Region          6739..>6774\n                     /region_name=\"Ephrin_rec_like\"\n                     /note=\"Tyrosine-protein kinase ephrin type A/B\n                     receptor-like; pfam07699\"\n                     /db_xref=\"CDD:429604\"\n     Region          <8679..9423\n                     /region_name=\"PTZ00121\"\n                     /note=\"MAEBL; Provisional\"\n                     /db_xref=\"CDD:173412\"\n     Region          9369..>9543\n                     /region_name=\"CAF-1_p150\"\n                     /note=\"Chromatin assembly factor 1 complex p150 subunit,\n                     N-terminal; pfam11600\"\n                     /db_xref=\"CDD:402959\"\n     CDS             1..9962\n                     /locus_tag=\"TZFLFO1EN2_LOCUS14340\"\n                     /coded_by=\"join(OZ276501.1:10823638..10823744,\n         