Y, Box 596, 751 24\n            UPPSALA, Sweden\nCOMMENT     'We used the MaSuRCA v3.3.5  with the support of the Flye assembler\n            making a hybrid assembly using short Illumina reads together with\n            long PacBio and MinION read. All raw reads (before contamination\n            removal) from three sequence technology were mapped on the MaSuRCA\n            assembly and their coverage depth was calculated by deepTools\n            v3.5.1. The mean coverage for Nanopore reads is 22.5 for up to 60%\n            of the assembly whereas, it is 26.6 with PacBio up to 45% of the\n            assembly. Reads from Illumina run1, run2, and run3 have relatively\n            higher mean values of 53.1, 40.9, and 27.2 with a lower fraction of\n            bases covered, respectively'.\nFEATURES             Location/Qualifiers\n     source          1..634\n                     /organism=\"Hexamita inflata\"\n                     /db_xref=\"taxon:28002\"\n                     /note=\"contig: contig_46\"\n     Protein         1..634\n                     /product=\"trichohyalin-like\"\n     Region          <4..564\n                     /region_name=\"PTZ00121\"\n                     /note=\"MAEBL; Provisional\"\n                     /db_xref=\"CDD:173412\"\n     CDS             1..634\n                     /locus_tag=\"HINF_LOCUS54328\"\n                     /standard_name=\"HIN_068777\"\n                     /coded_by=\"CAXDID020000282.1:18823..20727\"\n                     /note=\"ID:HINC00000017446;\n                     single-exon;\n                     source:GlimmerHMM\"\n                     /transl_table=6\nORIGIN      \n        1 msdqqneekl peietqnetn efqiengdnf eekdikrqek leqrqkerem kqeerqreqa\n       61 ekeaqkqkeq aekeaqkqke qaekeaqkqk eqaekeaqkq reqeereaqk qkeqaekeaq\n      121 kqreqeekea qkqkeqaeke aqkqkeqeer eaqkqreqae keakkqkeqa ekeaqkqkeq\n      181 eereaqkqre qeekeaqkqr eqeereaqkq reqeekeaqk qkeqaekeaq kqreqaekea\n      241 qkqreqeeke aqkqseqee