XBPINMAXI_10306.t1.cds4; ID:XBPINMAXI_10306.t1.cds5; ID:XBPINMAXI_10306.t1.cds6; ID:XBPINMAXI_10306.t1.cds7; ID:XBPINMAXI_10306.t1.cds8; ID:XBPINMAXI_10306.t1.cds9; source:AUGUSTUS"},"featureId":"CAN8123779.1:feature:23"}],"featureSummary":{"total":23,"sources":1,"genes":0,"proteins":1,"regions":17,"sites":3,"otherFeatures":1}},"rawText":"LOCUS       CAN8123779              2097 aa            linear   INV 10-SEP-2025\nDEFINITION  unnamed protein product [Pinctada maxima].\nACCESSION   CAN8123779\nVERSION     CAN8123779.1\nDBLINK      BioProject: PRJEB92378\n            BioSample: SAMEA118712865\n            Sequence Read Archive: ERR15277401, ERR15277402, ERR15277403,\n            ERR15277404, ERR15277405, ERR15277406, ERR15277407, ERR15277408,\n            ERR15277409, ERR15277410, ERR15277411, ERR15277412, ERR15277413,\n            ERR15277414, SRR11909995, SRR11909996, SRR11909997, SRR15827334,\n            SRR15827335, SRR15827336, SRR15827337, SRR15827338, SRR15827339,\n            SRR15827340, SRR18476391, SRR18476392, SRR18476393, SRR18476394,\n            SRR18476395, SRR18476396, SRR18476397, SRR18476398, SRR18476399,\n            SRR5272492, SRR5272493, SRR5272494, SRR5272495, SRR5272496,\n            SRR5272497\nDBSOURCE    embl accession OZ286403.1\nKEYWORDS    .\nSOURCE      Pinctada maxima (silver-lipped pearl oyster)\n  ORGANISM  Pinctada maxima\n            Eukaryota; Metazoa; Spiralia; Lophotrochozoa; Mollusca; Bivalvia;\n            Autobranchia; Pteriomorphia; Pterioida; Pterioidea; Pteriidae;\n            Pinctada.\nREFERENCE   1\n  AUTHORS   Laura,Benestan., Jeremy,Leluyer., Alexandre,Cormier.,\n            Thibault,Destanque., Jeremie,Vidal.-Dupiol., Celine,Reissier.,\n            Chin,Long., Dave,Jones. and Dean,Jerry.\n  TITLE     Direct Submission\n  JOURNAL   Submitted (21-JUL-2025)\n            laura.benestan@gmail.com,jeremy.leluyer@ifremer.fr,\n            alerxandre.cormier@ifremer.fr,Thibault.Destanque@ifremer.fr,\n            Jeremie.Vidal.Dupiol@ifremer.fr,celine.reisser@ifremer.fr,\n            chin-long.ky@ifremer.fr,david.jones3@jcu.edu.au,\n            dean.jerry@jcu.edu.au\nCOMMENT     The xbPinMaxi1.1 assembly represents the genome of a wild Pinctada\n            maxima (silver-lipped pearl oyster) individual, sampled at Roko\n            Pearl Farm, Roko Island, Queensland, Australia. DNA was extracted\n            from adult muscle tissue. Sequencing was performed using PacBio\n            Sequel, 10X Genomics (NovaSeq), and Hi-C. The assembly was\n            generated with Flye, corrected with Hapo-G, and purged with\n            Purge_dups. Hi-C data were mapped with the Arima pipeline,\n            scaffolded with YAHS, and manually curated with JBAT. Transcriptome\n            reads were aligned with Hisat2 and used for gene prediction with\n            Braker3. The genome spans 1.27 Gb in 14 chromosomes (N50: 209.20\n            Mb).\nFEATURES             Location/Qualifiers\n     source          1..2097\n                     /organism=\"Pinctada maxima\"\n                     /isolation_source=\"Roko pearl farm\"\n                     /db_xref=\"taxon:104660\"\n                     /chromosome=\"5\"\n                     /geo_loc_name=\"Australia:Queensland, Roko island\"\n     Protein         1..2097\n                     /name=\"unnamed protein product\"\n     Region          <62..264\n                     /region_name=\"ANKYR\"\n                     /note=\"Ankyrin repeat [Signal transduction mechanisms];\n                     COG0666\"\n                     /db_xref=\"CDD:440430\"\n     Site            order(75,77,81..82,85..87,89,100,104,107,116,118,120,\n                     124..125,128..130,132..133,137,140,149,151,153,157..158,\n                     197..199,201..202,206,209,218)\n                     /site_type=\"other\"\n                     /note=\"oligomer interface [polypeptide binding]\"\n                     /db_xref=\"CDD:293786\"\n     Region          75..116\n 