-seq experiments were assembled using fastp,\n            hisat2 and the stringtie package. MAKER was used for the build.\n            Augustus profiles from run (0,05 MSV , 3000 LD with 7924 training\n            genes) was selected for the abinitio run. Functional annotation\n            with Blast and InterProScan. tRNA have been predicted through\n            tRNAscan version.'.\nFEATURES             Location/Qualifiers\n     source          1..2654\n                     /organism=\"Coregonus albula\"\n                     /db_xref=\"taxon:36180\"\n                     /note=\"contig: RL_38\"\n     Protein         1..2654\n                     /product=\"Proline-rich protein 12\"\n     Region          2198..>2501\n                     /region_name=\"TolA\"\n                     /note=\"Membrane protein TolA involved in colicin uptake\n                     [Cell wall/membrane/envelope biogenesis]; COG3064\"\n                     /db_xref=\"CDD:442298\"\n     Region          2198..>2266\n                     /region_name=\"MAP7\"\n                     /note=\"MAP7 (E-MAP-115) family; pfam05672\"\n                     /db_xref=\"CDD:461709\"\n     Region          2468..2566\n                     /region_name=\"DUF4211\"\n                     /note=\"Domain of unknown function (DUF4211); pfam13926\"\n                     /db_xref=\"CDD:464045\"\n     CDS             1..2654\n                     /locus_tag=\"CORALB_LOCUS40501\"\n                     /standard_name=\"PRR12\"\n                     /coded_by=\"complement(join(CAWUPP020000037.1:42190593..421\n                     90727,CAWUPP020000037.1:42192363..42192458,\n                     CAWUPP020000037.1:42193273..42193407,\n                     CAWUPP020000037.1:42193612..42193709,\n                     CAWUPP020000037.1:42194029..42194148,\n                     CAWUPP020000037.1:42194406..42195424,\n                     CAWUPP020000037.1:42195656..42195789,\n                     CAWUPP020000037.1:42198215..421