o-like) are MKQG01002388-MKQG01004677. Sequences that\n            were unable to be distinguished between the haplotypes are\n            MKQG01004678-MKQG01007764.\n            \n            ##Genome-Assembly-Data-START##\n            Assembly Date             :: 15-MAR-2017\n            Assembly Method           :: Newbler v. 2.9\n            Genome Representation     :: Full\n            Expected Final Version    :: Yes\n            Reference-guided Assembly :: T. cruzi CL Brener (TriTryp database\n                                         v24)\n            Genome Coverage           :: 10.0x\n            Sequencing Technology     :: 454\n            ##Genome-Assembly-Data-END##\n            Method: conceptual translation.\nFEATURES             Location/Qualifiers\n     source          1..516\n                     /organism=\"Trypanosoma cruzi\"\n                     /strain=\"CL\"\n                     /host=\"Triatoma infestans\"\n                     /db_xref=\"taxon:5693\"\n                     /geo_loc_name=\"Brazil: Rio Grande do Sul\"\n                     /collection_date=\"1963\"\n     Protein         <1..516\n                     /product=\"hypothetical protein\"\n     Region          <1..>246\n                     /region_name=\"Smc\"\n                     /note=\"Chromosome segregation ATPase Smc [Cell cycle\n                     control, cell division, chromosome partitioning]; COG1196\"\n                     /db_xref=\"CDD:440809\"\n     CDS             1..516\n                     /locus_tag=\"TcCL_ESM05340\"\n                     /coded_by=\"MKQG01000086.1:<23405..24955\"\n                     /inference=\"ab initio prediction:GeneMarkS:4.7b\"\n                     /inference=\"similar to AA sequence:INSD:EKG05171.1\"\nORIGIN      \n        1 eeeaakrrqa eeeaekrhqa eeeaakrhqa eeeaakrrqa eeeaekrhqa eeeaakrhqa\n       61 eeeaerrrqa eeeaekrhqa eeeaakrrqa eeeaekrhqa eeeaakrhqa eeeaekrrqa\n      121 eeeaekrrqa eeeaekrrqa eeeaekrhqa eeeaekrrqa eeeaakrhqa 