 FCS-adaptor was used to remove putative adapters, and putative\n            contaminants were removed with FCS-GX. The chromosomes confirmed by\n            Hi-C data are named according to size.\nFEATURES             Location/Qualifiers\n     source          1..1401\n                     /organism=\"Lampetra fluviatilis\"\n                     /db_xref=\"taxon:7748\"\n                     /chromosome=\"63\"\n                     /geo_loc_name=\"Norway:Telemark, Asdalsaa\"\n                     /collection_date=\"2021-04-21\"\n     Protein         1..1401\n                     /name=\"unnamed protein product\"\n     Region          14..48\n                     /region_name=\"SAP\"\n                     /note=\"Putative DNA-binding (bihelical) motif predicted to\n                     be involved in chromosomal organisation; smart00513\"\n                     /db_xref=\"CDD:128789\"\n     Region          <128..760\n                     /region_name=\"PTZ00121\"\n                     /note=\"MAEBL; Provisional\"\n                     /db_xref=\"CDD:173412\"\n     Region          976..1062\n                     /region_name=\"RRM_ACINU\"\n                     /note=\"RNA recognition motif (RRM) found in apoptotic\n                     chromatin condensation inducer in the nucleus (acinus) and\n                     similar proteins; cd12432\"\n                     /db_xref=\"CDD:409866\"\n     Region          <1178..1207\n                     /region_name=\"RSB_motif\"\n                     /note=\"RNSP1-SAP18 binding (RSB) motif; pfam16294\"\n                     /db_xref=\"CDD:465085\"\n     Region          1307..>1390\n                     /region_name=\"U2AF_lg\"\n                     /note=\"U2 snRNP auxilliary factor, large subunit, splicing\n                     factor; TIGR01642\"\n                     /db_xref=\"CDD:273727\"\n     CDS             1..1401\n                     /locus_tag=\"KLAFL2V2EN1_LOCUS16877\"\n                     /coded_by=\"complement(joi